  outcomeRecord: "---\nslug: portable-skill-defaults\nshipped: 2026-09-25\nschemaVersion: 1\n---\n# portable-skill-defaults\n\nPortable skill defaults resolve per-instance modes and runtime checks while preserving explicit override behavior.\nOriginal source decisions, contradictions and verification limits are retained in the linked supplement.\nThis legacy upgrade makes no new execution or live-quality claim.\n\n- outcome: Portable skill defaults resolve per-instance modes and runtime checks while preserving explicit override behavior.\n- docs: [source supplement](.project/records/legacy-upgrades/portable-skill-defaults.md)\n- decisions: [retained decisions](.project/records/legacy-upgrades/portable-skill-defaults.md)\n- knowledge: [lessons and constraints](.project/records/legacy-upgrades/portable-skill-defaults.md)\n- code: none\n- verification: [historical verification](.project/records/legacy-upgrades/portable-skill-defaults.md)\n- followups: [retained limits](.project/records/legacy-upgrades/portable-skill-defaults.md), [backlog](.project/pitches/_followups.md)\n- archive: [reviewed recovery record](.project/records/legacy-upgrades/portable-skill-defaults.md)\n"
